TeleDesign bundled seeds (services/design/seeds/)
=================================================

The seed design systems and style archetypes in this directory are original
TeleDesign work, released under the same terms as the rest of this repository,
EXCEPT for the third-party material listed below.

Nothing in this directory is copied from pen.dev (its bundled .lib.pen
libraries or its style archetypes) or from Claude Design's shipped systems.
The .pen files follow pen.dev's publicly documented file schema (version
"2.19") only; no pen.dev code, assets or content are included. None of the
systems or styles is named after, or imitates, a real brand.


