2. open-design — Apache License 2.0
-----------------------------------
Source:  https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design, design-systems/default
         (DESIGN.md, USAGE.md, manifest.json)
Used in: systems/neutral/DESIGN.md and systems/*/USAGE.md
What:    adapted, not copied verbatim — the idea of a USAGE.md "read order"
         preceding DESIGN.md / tokens / component manifest, and three agent
         guidance rules in systems/neutral ("let whitespace separate groups",
         "no drop shadows on inputs / no more than three type sizes per
         screen", "do not invent colour values — surface a warning and use the
         closest token"). Section structure of DESIGN.md is TeleDesign's own
         (docs/teledesign.md §3).
Changes: rewritten for TeleDesign's token names, file layout and adherence
         lint; colour values replaced by shadcn/ui's.

